<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grace, Advanced cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grace, Advanced cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Friday it had cut its ratings for both W.R. Grace &amp; Co and Advanced Tissue Sciences Inc to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Advanced Tissue plummeted 6-3/8 to 8-1/4 at the market opening. W.R. Grace closed at 55 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
